    "  • Low tier: Only critical alerts",
    "",
    "📊 Loading alerts for dependencies: elasticsearch, redis",
    "  ✓ elasticsearch: 6 alerts (5 fixed)",
    "  ✓ redis: 8 alerts (7 fixed)",
    "",
    "✅ Generated 14 total alerts",
